        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Very strange organisation of work! I had an appointment for my elderly mother at 7:15 . We came at 7;00 as recommended and found the door locked and a notice :Today 7 February, Dynacare will be open at 7:30. It is 6 February today. 7:20, and nobody is here. Very disappointed!",
